  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/17ee53f0aa3cebaac16ad79ae2fa79e562336dde52fe9a4fd41bdb0c7ce4a2a3.png] \n\nLet's check each option,\n\n1) **11 and 4**\n\n→ [(**39 – 3**) ÷ 6] + 4 × 2 – 11 × 5 = 13\n\n→ **[36 ÷ 6]** + 4 × 2 – 11 × 5 = 13\n\n→ 12 + **4**** × 2** – **11**** × 5** = 13\n\n→ **12 + 8** – 55 = 13\n\n→ 20 – 55 = 13\n\n→ - 35 ≠ 13\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n2) **2 and 6**\n\n→ [(**39 – 3**) ÷ 2] + 11 × 6 – 4 × 5 = 13\n\n→ [**36 ÷ 2**] + 11 × 6 – 4 × 5 = 13\n\n→ 18 + **11 × 6** – **4 × 5** = 13\n\n→ **18 + 66** – 20 = 13\n\n→ 84 – 20 = 13\n\n→ 64 ≠ 13\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS **\n\n3) **2 and 5 **\n\n→ [(**39 – 3**) ÷ 6] + 11 × 5 – 4 × 2 = 13\n\n→ [**36 ÷ 6**] + 11 × 5 – 4 × 2 = 13\n\n→ 6 + **11 × 5** – **4 × 2** = 13\n\n→ **6 + 55** – 8 = 13\n\n→ 61 – 8 = 13\n\n→ 53 ≠ 13\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS **\n\n4) **3 and 6**\n\n→ [(**39 – 6**) ÷ 3] + 11 × 2 – 4 × 5 = 13\n\n→ [**33 ÷ 3**] + 11 × 2 – 4 × 5 = 13\n\n→ 11 + **11 × 2** – **4 × 5** = 13\n\n→ **11 + 22** – 20 = 13\n\n→ 33 – 20 = 13\n\n→ 13 = 13\n\n→ **LHS = RHS ⇒ Satisfies the equation.**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"****3 and 6\"**.",
